; CHECK: errors.pas:20:31: error: the index of a property must be an integer constant
; CHECK: errors.pas:21:41: error: the default value of property 'Y' must be a constant of type 'integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:22:14: error: only an array property can be the default property
; CHECK: errors.pas:22:14: error: class 'TA' already has a default property
; CHECK: errors.pas:14:14: note: 'Q' declared here
; CHECK: errors.pas:43:32: error: 'FS' is a strict private member of 'TA'
